{"id":"n1-126","title":"Verb たことにしてください (~ ta koto ni shite kudasai)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Asking someone to pretend or accept that something has already happened or taken a certain state.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 'Verb たことにしてください' is used to request someone to act as if or pretend that a certain action has already occurred or a certain state exists. It is used in various contexts to express the idea of accepting a hypothetical situation for convenience or to avoid conflicts.","formation":"Verb (past, casual) + ことにしてください","examples":[{"jp":"昨日のことは忘れたことにしてください。","romaji":"Kinou no koto wa wasureta koto ni shite kudasai.","en":"Please act as if you have forgotten about yesterday.","words":[{"surface":"昨日","vocabId":"1579260","reading":"きのう"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忘れ","vocabId":"1519210","reading":"わすれる","baseForm":"忘れる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8,9,10]},{"jp":"私がここに来たことを誰にも言わないで、秘密にしたことにしてください。","romaji":"Watashi ga koko ni kita koto o dare ni mo iwanaide, himitsu ni shita koto ni shite kudasai.","en":"Please don't tell anyone that I came here; act as if it’s a secret.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ここ","vocabId":"1288810","reading":"ここ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"秘密","vocabId":"1484150","reading":"ひみつ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[19,20,21,22,23]},{"jp":"彼が間違えたと思ったことにしてください。","romaji":"Kare ga machigaeta to omotta koto ni shite kudasai.","en":"Please pretend that you think he made a mistake.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"間違え","vocabId":"2017170","reading":"まちがえ","baseForm":"間違える"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思っ","vocabId":"1589350","reading":"おもう","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9,10,11]},{"jp":"彼女が帰ったことにしてください。","romaji":"Kanojo ga kaetta koto ni shite kudasai.","en":"Let’s pretend that she has gone home.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"帰っ","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえる","baseForm":"帰る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270",